              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The decision clarifies that a non\u2011citizen may collaterally attack a removal order under \u00a7\u202f1326(d) only if he can show exhaustion of administrative remedies, that the removal proceedings deprived him of judicial review, and that the order was fundamentally unfair, limiting the scope of challenges to removal orders."
      }
